<PageTitle>Attachment — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Attachment</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A file attached to a message: its thumbnail, its name and size, and what you can do with it.
    shadcn ships it with the AI components; nothing about it is specific to a model, and the demo's
    file manager and chat blocks both use it.
</p>

